<title>NEW ZEALAND: Shotover Jet half year loss widens.</title>
<headline>Shotover Jet half year loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result to Sept 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				   0.66 vs 0.05 loss</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		   debit 2.84 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover			     10.41 vs 10.86</p>
<p>    Equity earnings	     debit 0.08 vs 0.06 debit</p>
<p>Shotover Jet Ltd is a tourist operator.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
